--   **Context.** CRT reversal §12: **`CrtNeed6`**
--
--   `crtNeed6 : ∀ P, P.Ok → CrtNeed6 P`.
--
--   The table is `mTab4 tab ext₁ ext0 ext0 ext0 own` with `ext₁` the table of `IL.SwapNeedτ tab P.τ`
--   and `own = [phiFE, phiBE]` (KFUU's uniform `Φ`, `Φ⁻¹` with the reversal `revE`, whose phase 2 uses
--   three composite swaps of `h⌊d/2⌋`-bit digits and six digit-selector rotation sets instead of
--   KFUU's `⌊d/2⌋` single-digit swaps). `RowUCP` is not used.
--
--   Cost: `c ≤ C₀ · T p · Ncost6` with `A = 0`, from
--
--   * the frozen part (`natCost`, `O((d+1) T p)` once `d + 1 ≤ 2^h`),
--   * the rest of `p2E` (`O((d+1) T p)` once `d + 1 ≤ 2^h` and `T ≥ poly(b)`),
--   * three composite swaps, each `≤ K (4 T p ℓ (d ln p)^τ + 96 T p)`.
